{
  "ver": 1,
  "meta": {
    "title": "Mills Smart Log",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-20"
  },
  "id": "screen-022--form-weighbridge-web",
  "name": "Form Weighbridge (Web)",
  "module_id": "module-web-station-data",
  "route": "/data/weighbridge/create (buat baru), /data/weighbridge/{id}/edit (ubah)",
  "auth_requirement": "authenticated",
  "actor_permissions": [
    {
      "actor_id": "actor-supervisor",
      "can_access": true,
      "conditions": ""
    },
    {
      "actor_id": "actor-mill-management",
      "can_access": true,
      "conditions": ""
    },
    {
      "actor_id": "actor-admin",
      "can_access": true,
      "conditions": ""
    }
  ],
  "api_contracts": [
    {
      "usecase_id": "usecase-022--form-weighbridge-web",
      "usecase_name": "Input & Edit Data Weighbridge (Web)",
      "endpoints": [
        {
          "method": "POST",
          "path": "/api/weighbridge-records",
          "description": "Membuat record Weighbridge baru; station diresolve dari business_unit_id",
          "auth_required": true,
          "request": {
            "path_params": [],
            "query_params": [],
            "body_schema": {
              "business_unit_id": "uuid, required",
              "wb_card_number": "string, required",
              "weighbridge_type": "enum(receive, dispatch), required",
              "record_datetime": "timestamp, required",
              "vehicle_number": "string, required",
              "driver_name": "string, required",
              "estate_supplier": "string, required",
              "destination": "string, required jika dispatch",
              "division": "string, optional",
              "block": "string, optional",
              "gross_weight": "float, required",
              "tare_weight": "float, optional",
              "quantity": "float, optional",
              "checked": "boolean, optional",
              "acknowledged": "boolean, optional"
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "success_schema": {
              "id": "uuid",
              "station_id": "uuid",
              "station_name": "string",
              "wb_card_number": "string",
              "weighbridge_type": "enum(receive, dispatch)",
              "record_datetime": "timestamp",
              "net_weight": "float|null",
              "status": "string"
            },
            "error_codes": [
              {
                "http_code": 422,
                "error_code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
                "condition": "field wajib kosong"
              },
              {
                "http_code": 422,
                "error_code": "NO_ACTIVE_WEIGHBRIDGE_STATION",
                "condition": "business unit tanpa station weighbridge aktif"
              }
            ]
          },
          "performance": {
            "cache": "No cache",
            "rate_limit": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "method": "PATCH",
          "path": "/api/weighbridge-records/{id}",
          "description": "Memperbarui record Weighbridge tersimpan",
          "auth_required": true,
          "request": {
            "path_params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "type": "uuid",
                "description": "ID record"
              }
            ],
            "query_params": [],
            "body_schema": {
              "wb_card_number": "string, required",
              "weighbridge_type": "enum(receive, dispatch), required",
              "record_datetime": "timestamp, required",
              "vehicle_number": "string, required",
              "driver_name": "string, required",
              "estate_supplier": "string, required",
              "destination": "string, required jika dispatch",
              "division": "string, optional",
              "block": "string, optional",
              "gross_weight": "float, required",
              "tare_weight": "float, optional",
              "quantity": "float, optional",
              "checked": "boolean, optional",
              "acknowledged": "boolean, optional"
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "success_schema": {
              "id": "uuid",
              "station_id": "uuid",
              "wb_card_number": "string",
              "net_weight": "float|null",
              "status": "string"
            },
            "error_codes": [
              {
                "http_code": 422,
                "error_code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
                "condition": "field wajib kosong"
              },
              {
                "http_code": 404,
                "error_code": "RECORD_NOT_FOUND",
                "condition": "id tidak ditemukan"
              }
            ]
          },
          "performance": {
            "cache": "No cache",
            "rate_limit": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "business_logic": [
        "1. Create: validate field wajib termasuk destination jika dispatch -> 422 VALIDATION_ERROR",
        "2. Create: resolve station = Station WHERE business_unit_id AND type=weighbridge AND is_active=true -> 422 NO_ACTIVE_WEIGHBRIDGE_STATION jika tidak ada",
        "3. checked=true+role=supervisor -> checked_by=requester id; acknowledged=true+role=mill_management -> acknowledged_by=requester id; role lain diabaikan",
        "4. INSERT record status=saved, net_weight dihitung model event, tidak menerima override",
        "5. Update: validate id -> 404 jika tidak ada -> validate field wajib -> 422 jika gagal",
        "6. Update: business_unit_id/station_id tidak diterima dari body, tidak berubah",
        "7. UPDATE record, net_weight dihitung ulang model event",
        "8. FE: mode create tampilkan dropdown Business Unit (GET /api/business-units); mode edit GET /api/weighbridge-records/{id} untuk prefill, BU ditampilkan read-only",
        "9. FE: tab Tipe default Receive (create) atau tersimpan (edit); ganti tab reset record_datetime & destination ke default",
        "10. FE: record_datetime input datetime-local, default waktu saat ini, tetap dapat diedit manual",
        "11. FE: Net Weight dihitung reaktif untuk preview tapi field disabled (invariant data, dikecualikan dari konvensi web-form-input)",
        "12. FE: checkbox Checked hanya untuk role supervisor, Acknowledged hanya mill_management",
        "13. Simpan berhasil -> navigasi ke Detail Weighbridge",
        "14. Batal -> kembali tanpa API call"
      ],
      "data_operations": [
        {
          "entity_id": "weighbridge-record",
          "operation": "INSERT",
          "description": "INSERT record baru"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "weighbridge-record",
          "operation": "UPDATE",
          "description": "UPDATE record edit"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "weighbridge-record",
          "operation": "SELECT",
          "description": "SELECT untuk prefill edit"
        },
        {
          "entity_id": "station",
          "operation": "SELECT",
          "description": "Resolve station aktif dari business_unit_id"
        }
      ],
      "edge_case_handling": [
        {
          "condition": "Field wajib kosong",
          "handling": "422 VALIDATION_ERROR"
        },
        {
          "condition": "BU tanpa station weighbridge aktif",
          "handling": "422 NO_ACTIVE_WEIGHBRIDGE_STATION"
        },
        {
          "condition": "id tidak ditemukan (update)",
          "handling": "404 RECORD_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        {
          "condition": "Ganti tab tipe setelah terisi",
          "handling": "FE reset tanggal & destination"
        },
        {
          "condition": "checked/acknowledged oleh role tidak berhak",
          "handling": "diabaikan diam-diam"
        }
      ],
      "business_rules_applied": [
        "Tidak ada draft/pause di web",
        "record_datetime default sekarang, tetap dapat diedit",
        "Net Weight dihitung model event, tidak menerima override",
        "Checked By hanya Supervisor, Acknowledged By hanya Mill Management",
        "Business Unit tidak berubah setelah dibuat"
      ],
      "unit_test_cases": [
        {
          "description": "creates record with resolved station_id when valid (receive)",
          "given": "valid body type=receive, BU punya 1 station weighbridge aktif",
          "expect": "record insert dengan station_id sesuai, status=saved"
        },
        {
          "description": "creates record when type=dispatch with destination",
          "given": "valid body type=dispatch, destination terisi",
          "expect": "record insert dengan destination tersimpan"
        },
        {
          "description": "422 VALIDATION_ERROR when destination empty and type=dispatch",
          "given": "type=dispatch, destination kosong",
          "expect": "ValidationException errors.destination"
        },
        {
          "description": "422 VALIDATION_ERROR when required field empty",
          "given": "wb_card_number kosong",
          "expect": "ValidationException errors.wb_card_number"
        },
        {
          "description": "422 NO_ACTIVE_WEIGHBRIDGE_STATION when BU has no active weighbridge station",
          "given": "Station query kosong",
          "expect": "throw NoActiveWeighbridgeStationException"
        },
        {
          "description": "sets checked_by when checked=true and role=supervisor",
          "given": "checked=true, role=supervisor",
          "expect": "checked_by=requester id"
        },
        {
          "description": "ignores checked=true when role is not supervisor",
          "given": "checked=true, role=mill_management",
          "expect": "checked_by tetap null, tidak error"
        },
        {
          "description": "sets acknowledged_by when acknowledged=true and role=mill_management",
          "given": "acknowledged=true, role=mill_management",
          "expect": "acknowledged_by=requester id"
        },
        {
          "description": "updates record without accepting business_unit_id change",
          "given": "PATCH tanpa business_unit_id",
          "expect": "station_id tidak berubah"
        },
        {
          "description": "404 RECORD_NOT_FOUND when updating non-existent id",
          "given": "findOrFail throws",
          "expect": "404 RECORD_NOT_FOUND"
        },
        {
          "description": "recomputes net_weight on update via model event",
          "given": "update gross/tare weight",
          "expect": "net_weight = gross-tare baru"
        },
        {
          "description": "returns success with resolved station_name",
          "given": "create/update sukses",
          "expect": "response berisi station_name via relasi"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "shared_entities": [
    {
      "entity_id": "station",
      "operations": [
        "SELECT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "entity_id": "business-unit",
      "operations": [
        "SELECT"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "screen_dependencies": [
    {
      "screen_id": "screen-016--data-browser-weighbridge-web",
      "reason": "Entry point mode create"
    },
    {
      "screen_id": "screen-019--detail-weighbridge-web",
      "reason": "Entry point mode edit dan tujuan navigasi setelah Simpan"
    }
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "DIVERGENSI DARI MOBILE: record_datetime pada web default waktu saat ini namun TETAP dapat diedit manual - berbeda dari mobile (screen-010) yang menguncinya. Gunakan input type=datetime-local",
    "DIVERGENSI DARI MOBILE: data web dapat diedit setelah tersimpan (mode edit penuh), tidak ada draft/pause - status langsung saved",
    "PENGECUALIAN konvensi web-form-input: Net Weight tetap disabled karena WeighbridgeRecord model event selalu menghitung ulang net_weight=gross-tare untuk semua entry point - field editable akan menyesatkan karena nilai user akan ditimpa diam-diam saat disimpan. Setara pengecualian role-based Checked By/Acknowledged By, hanya beda alasan (data-integrity)",
    "Business Unit dropdown reuse GET /api/business-units (sudah ada, publik)",
    "Mode edit prefill reuse GET /api/weighbridge-records/{id} (screen-019)",
    "Route web /data/weighbridge/create HARUS didaftarkan SEBELUM /data/weighbridge/{id} agar tidak tertangkap sebagai {id}",
    "Checked/Acknowledged sebagai checkbox self-attestation, mengisi checked_by/acknowledged_by dengan id user login"
  ],
  "test_scenarios": [
    {
      "scenario_ref": "Buat Record Weighbridge Baru - berhasil",
      "usecase_id": "usecase-022--form-weighbridge-web",
      "api_test": [
        {
          "step": 1,
          "endpoint": {
            "method": "POST",
            "path": "/api/weighbridge-records"
          },
          "request_example": {
            "business_unit_id": "{{business_unit_uuid}}",
            "wb_card_number": "WB-WEB-001",
            "weighbridge_type": "receive",
            "record_datetime": "2026-08-20T08:00:00Z",
            "vehicle_number": "B 1234 XY",
            "driver_name": "Budi",
            "estate_supplier": "Estate A",
            "gross_weight": 15000
          },
          "expected_status": 201,
          "expected_error_code": null
        }
      ],
      "component_test": {
        "component": "FormWeighbridge",
        "action": "pilih Business Unit, isi field wajib tipe Receive, klik Simpan",
        "assert": "record tersimpan, navigasi ke Detail Weighbridge"
      },
      "browser_test": {
        "route": "/data/weighbridge/create",
        "action": "klik Tambah Data, isi form, klik Simpan",
        "assert": "halaman Detail menampilkan record baru"
      }
    },
